OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after pedestrian
OL,4,Akilled on A14
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have asked for witnesses to come
OL,7,Fforward, after a pedestrian was struck
OL,8,Fand killed on the A14 near Cambridge.
OL,10,FA white Yutong coach was travelling
OL,11,Feastbound between Histon and Milton at
OL,12,F13:35 BST on Saturday when it hit a
OL,13,F33-year-old man.
OL,15,FCambridgeshire Police said the man,
OL,16,Ffrom Cambridge, was pronounced dead at
OL,17,Fthe scene.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
