OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after pedestrian
OL,4,Akilled on A14
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the coach, a 39-year-old
OL,7,Fman from Peterborough, was uninjured,
OL,8,Fpolice added. Officers have appealed
OL,9,Ffor anyone with information, including
OL,10,Fdashcam footage, to get in touch.
